usage: csk status [-h] [--all] [--check] [--attest] [--json] [target]

positional arguments:
  target      project alias, '.', or project path

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --all       show all registered projects
  --check     exit non-zero unless every skill is up-to-date
  --attest    re-check installed skills against trusted audit registries
  --json      print machine-readable JSON instead of the table

Labels:
  up-to-date, missing, update-available, content-drift, error

Files read:
  ~/.cocoaskills/config.json, Skillfile.json, .agents/skills/*/.csk-install.json

Examples:
  csk status
  csk status --all
  csk status demo-app-ios
  csk status .
